#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:73
msgid "Add search keywords and stop keywords to a post in the editor sidebar, in quick edit or in bulk edit. A search that matches a keyword shows the post even when its title and content do not match. A search that matches a stop keyword hides the post even when its title or content match. To keep a post out of every search, turn on \"Hide from site search\" in the editor sidebar, in quick edit, or with the bulk action."
